Rationale: Unchanged Gaussian quaternion and packed SH data must be recopied when shared attributes move or reallocate; otherwise orientation/radiance can become stale.
Contract: Repopulate unchanged quaternion and packed SH attributes whenever the shared buffer is reallocated or its layout changes, preserving Gaussian radiance and orientation during object insertion/removal without forcing unrelated geometry conversion.
Tests: tests/houdini_blender53_gsplats_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

